{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"codex_apps","tool":"github_fetch_issue_comments","arguments":{"repo_full_name":"vamseeachanta/workspace-hub","issue_number":2632},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"comments\": [{\"url\": \"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/workspace-hub/issues/2632#issuecomment-4376362462\", \"body\": \"## Plan-review ready: canonical plan drafted and adversarial review resolved\\n\\nCanonical plan:\\n- `docs/plans/2026-05-04-issue-2632-llm-wiki-approval-binding-rot-sweep.md`\\n\\nReview artifacts:\\n- `scripts/review/results/2026-05-04-plan-2632-claude.md`\\n- `scripts/review/results/2026-05-04-plan-2632-gemini.md`\\n\\nDisposition:\\n- Status moved to `status:plan-review` for user approval review.\\n- Claude-internal adversarial review raised MAJOR findings; the plan was revised and the findings are recorded as resolved in the plan and artifact.\\n- Gemini/Codex are not being used as blocking gates for this pass; Codex remains unavailable due vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2479 stdin-hang regression, and Gemini has a rerun path recorded in the artifact.\\n\\nGovernance boundaries preserved:\\n- No self-approval.\\n- No `status:plan-approved` move.\\n- No approval marker creation.\\n- No `/mnt/ace` raw-data copy into git.\\n\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"vamseeachanta\", \"name\": \"vamseeachanta\", \"email\": null, \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23155845?v=4\", \"id\": 23155845}, \"id\": 4376362462, \"pull_request_review_id\": null, \"in_reply_to_id\": null, \"created_at\": null, \"review\": null, \"side\": null, \"line\": null, \"start_line\": null, \"path\": null, \"body_html\": \"<h2 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Plan-review ready: canonical plan drafted and adversarial review resolved</h2>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Canonical plan:</p>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">docs/plans/2026-05-04-issue-2632-llm-wiki-approval-binding-rot-sweep.md</code></li>\\n<