bilical-systems`, `syllabus-snapshot` \\u2192 Type: `doris-training-source`\\n\\nPost-cleanup verification: Sources table has 24 data rows matching the 24 `.md` files in `sources/` exactly (verified by `diff` between `grep \\\"sources/[^)]+\\\\.md\\\" index.md` and `ls sources/*.md`).\\n\\n**Still deferred (out of scope, separate cleanup needed):** 8 concept-page rows still under `## Comparisons` (subsea-production-system-overview, subsea-production-control-system, subsea-umbilical-system, installation-workover-control-system, methanol-injection-analysis, umbilical-tube-sizing-api-17e, hydrostatic-pressure-depth, subsea-accumulator-sizing) \\u2014 these need dedup against the main Concepts table.\\n\\n### (4) Workspace-hub artifact bundling \\u2192 checked, all present\\n\\nConfirmed via `git log --oneline -- <path>` that all 4 #2659 artifacts are at `vamseeachanta/workspace-hub` HEAD via commit `6caba5fc9` (\\\"oss-wiki-development-arc methodology\\\"):\\n\\n- `docs/governance/2026-05-09-anthropics-financial-services-ingest-design.md`\\n- `scripts/review/results/2026-05-09-plan-2659-codex.md`\\n- `scripts/review/results/2026-05-09-plan-2659-codex-r2.md`\\n- `scripts/review/results/2026-05-09-plan-2659-codex-r3.md`\\n\\nProvenance commit [`e489288b0`](https://github.com/vamseeachanta/workspace-hub/commit/e489288b0) (\\\"docs(provenance): note bundled scope of 6caba5fc9\\\") landed and explains the bundle. No corrective action needed; the audit trail is complete via the bundle disclosure.\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"vamseeachanta\", \"name\": \"vamseeachanta\", \"email\": null, \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23155845?v=4\", \"id\": 23155845}, \"id\": 4415619117, \"pull_request_review_id\": null, \"in_reply_to_id\": null, \"created_at\": null, \"review\": null, \"side\": null, \"line\": null, \"start_line\": null, \"path\": null, \"body_html\": \"<h2 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Follow-up \\u2014 push complete + bonus index-cleanup commit</h2>\\n<p dir=\