117","body":"## Follow-up — push complete + bonus index-cleanup commit\n\nPer user authorization on the four open follow-ups:\n\n### (1) Push authorized → pushed\n\nBoth commits now on `vamseeachanta/llm-wiki` origin/main:\n\n- [`f5e533d6`](https://github.com/vamseeachanta/llm-wiki/commit/f5e533d6) — Add anthropics/financial-services as managed-agent reference source (engineering/) — the originally-approved scope.\n- [`7f5a13fc`](https://github.com/vamseeachanta/llm-wiki/commit/7f5a13fc) — Reconcile orphan source-table rows in engineering/wiki/index.md — the bonus index-cleanup commit (item 3 below).\n\nLocal and origin in sync (`ahead/behind: 0/0`).\n\n### (2) Concept-page gap deferred → noted, no action\n\n`concepts/managed-agent-orchestration.md` remains a deferred YAGNI item.\n\n### (3) Index format-drift cleanup → executed in `7f5a13fc`\n\nScope was wider than initially indicated: 9 source rows were stranded after `## Comparisons` (2 in broken `[[double-bracket]]` wikilink syntax, 7 in 3-column format missing the Type column). All 9 consolidated into the canonical 4-column Sources table in chronological order:\n\n- `elements-digitalmodel-qgis`, `elements-doris-university` → Type: `elements-ingest-catalog`\n- `doris-university-module-1-00` through `1-03`, `lunch-and-learn-control-systems`, `lunch-and-learn-umbilical-systems`, `syllabus-snapshot` → Type: `doris-training-source`\n\nPost-cleanup verification: Sources table has 24 data rows matching the 24 `.md` files in `sources/` exactly (verified by `diff` between `grep \"sources/[^)]+\\.md\" index.md` and `ls sources/*.md`).\n\n**Still deferred (out of scope, separate cleanup needed):** 8 concept-page rows still under `## Comparisons` (subsea-production-system-overview, subsea-production-control-system, subsea-umbilical-system, installation-workover-control-system, methanol-injection-analysis, umbilical-tube-sizing-api-17e, hydrostatic-pressure-depth, subsea-accumulator-sizing) — these need dedup against the mai