red:\\n- Packaged SIROCCO/B1528 current-heading/rudder YAML input contract.\\n- TDD-backed calculation/report module for current speeds 1, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3, 3.5, 4, 4.5 kn plus the requested chart-default 4.56 kn plane.\\n- Heading sweep `-10..+10 deg` in 1 deg steps and rudder sweep `-10..+10 deg` in 1 deg steps.\\n- Generated force-component outputs: CSV, JSON, provenance JSON, Markdown report, interactive HTML report, and manifest under `outputs/b1528_sirocco/current_heading_rudder/`.\\n- Two-chart interactive HTML contract:\\n  - Chart 1: ship-fixed `X_ship`, `Y_ship`, and resultant force over heading for selected current speed and selected rudder angle.\\n  - Chart 2: signed `N_ship` yaw-moment heatmap over heading \\u00d7 rudder for selected current speed.\\n  - Current-speed dropdown defaults to `4.56 kn`; rudder dropdown defaults to `+10 deg` for visible first-view response.\\n- Durable documentation at `docs/domains/marine-engineering/b1528-sirocco-current-heading-rudder-report.md`.\\n\\nValidation evidence:\\n- `PYTHONPATH=src uv run python -m pytest tests/naval_architecture/test_b1528_sirocco_current_heading_rudder.py -q` \\u2192 12 passed.\\n- `git diff --cached --check` before commit \\u2192 pass.\\n- JSON artifact validation with `python -m json.tool` for results/provenance/manifest \\u2192 pass.\\n- Static HTML contract smoke \\u2192 force chart present, heatmap present, 4.56 selected, rudder +10 selected, embedded rows present.\\n- Public artifact hygiene scan for `/tmp/`, `/home/`, `/mnt/local-analysis`, and local worktree names across generated HTML/JSON/MD/CSV \\u2192 no matches.\\n- Browser verification on generated HTML: default chart state `4.56 kn` / `10 deg`, then dropdown update to `3.5 kn` / `5 deg`; force chart retained 3 traces, heatmap retained 21\\u00d721 grid and updated titles.\\n- Adversarial review returned MINOR only; hygiene findings were fixed before final validation (absolute summary semantics, YAML-driven traceability, dropdown test coverage).\\n\\nScope caveat retained in artifacts: this is a bounded rudder-induced force-component chart set. It is not a validated oblique-current hull/rudder interaction model and does not include hull current loads, mooring-line stiffness, tug loads, bank effects, current-profile variation, or class/IMO compliance conclusions.\\n\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"vamseeachanta\", \"name\": \"vamseeachanta\", \"email\": null, \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23155845?v=4\", \"id\": 23155845}, \"id\": 4414452432, \"pull_request_review_id\": null, \"in_reply_to_id\": null, \"created_at\": null, \"review\": null, \"side\": null, \"line\": null, \"start_line\": null, \"path\": null, \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Result: landed and verified for issue <a class=\\\"issue-link js-issue-link\\\" data-error-text=\\\"Failed to load title\\\" data-id=\\\"4409773801\\\" data-permission-text=\\\"Title is private\\\" data-url=\\\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/issues/598\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"issue\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/issues/598/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/issues/598\\\">#598</a>.</p>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Commit: <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/commit/8867bcfc1c285414c381687ebd832b9c9773cbe0/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/commit/8867bcfc1c285414c381687ebd832b9c9773cbe0\\\"><tt>8867bcf</tt></a> (<code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">feat: add SIROCCO current heading rudder charts</code>)<br>\\nRemote verification: <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">origin/main</code> = <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/commit/8867bcfc1c285414c381687ebd832b9c9773cbe0/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/commit/88