on.tool</code> for results/provenance/manifest \\u2192 pass.</li>\\n<li>Static HTML contract smoke \\u2192 force chart present, heatmap present, 4.56 selected, rudder +10 selected, embedded rows present.</li>\\n<li>Public artifact hygiene scan for <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">/tmp/</code>, <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">/home/</code>, <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">/mnt/local-analysis</code>, and local worktree names across generated HTML/JSON/MD/CSV \\u2192 no matches.</li>\\n<li>Browser verification on generated HTML: default chart state <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">4.56 kn</code> / <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">10 deg</code>, then dropdown update to <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">3.5 kn</code> / <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">5 deg</code>; force chart retained 3 traces, heatmap retained 21\\u00d721 grid and updated titles.</li>\\n<li>Adversarial review returned MINOR only; hygiene findings were fixed before final validation (absolute summary semantics, YAML-driven traceability, dropdown test coverage).</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Scope caveat retained in artifacts: this is a bounded rudder-induced force-component chart set. It is not a validated oblique-current hull/rudder interaction model and does not include hull current loads, mooring-line stiffness, tug loads, bank effects, current-profile variation, or class/IMO compliance conclusions.</p>\"}], \"url\": \"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/issues/598\", \"title\": \"vamseeachanta/digitalmodel Issue #598 comments\", \"display_url\": \"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/issues/598\", \"display_title\": \"vamseeachanta/digitalmodel Issue #598 comments\"}"}],"structured_content":{"comments":[{"url":"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/issues/598#issuecomment-4410353948","body":"Plan prepared and pushed for review.\n\nPlan artifact:\n- https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/blob/main/docs/plans/2026-05-08-issue-598-sirocco-current-heading-rudder-force-components.md\n\nReview status:\n- Initial adversarial review: `MAJOR`\n- Plan revised to resolve frame/heading transform, sign convention, 4.56 kn handling, chart coverage, tests, and template-section gaps.\n- Re-review verdict: `APPROVE`\n\nKey approval choices before implementation:\n1. Accept proposed ship-fixed output convention:\n   - positive heading `psi` rotates local downstream current-force axis toward port;\n   - positive rudder `delta` is rudder-to-port;\n   - effective rudder inflow angle `alpha = delta - psi`;\n   - local force components are rotated to ship-fixed `X_ship/Y_ship`, with `N_ship = Y_ship * yaw_lever`.\n2. Accept proposed default-speed handling:\n   - engineering sweep remains `[1, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3, 3.5, 4, 4.5] kn`;\n   - `4.56 kn` is added as an extra chart-default calculation plane and flagged as outside the requested engineering sweep.\n\nHard stop: no implementation until user approval and `status:plan-approved`.\n","user":{"login":"vamseeachanta","name":"vamseeachanta","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23155845?v=4","id":23155845},"id":4410353948,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":null,"review":null,"side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":"<p dir=\"auto\">Plan prepared and pushed for review.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Plan artifact:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/blob/main/docs/plans/2026-05-08-issue-598-sirocco-current-heading-rudder-force-components.md\">https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/blob/main/docs/plans/2026-05-08-issue-598-sirocco-current-heading-rudder-force-components.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Review status:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Initial adversarial review: <code class=\"notranslate\">MAJOR</code></li>\n<li>Plan revised to resolve frame/heading transform, sign convention, 4.56 kn handling, chart coverage, tests, and template-section gaps.</li>\n<li>Re-review verdict: <code class=\"notranslate\">APPROVE</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Key approval choices before implementation:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Accept proposed ship-fixed output convention:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>positive heading <code class=\"notranslate\">psi</code> rotates local downstream current-force axis toward port;</li>\n<li>positive rudder <code class=\"notranslate\">delta</code> is rudder-to-port;</li>\n<li>effective rudder inflow angle <code class=\"notranslate\">alpha = delta - psi</code>;</li>\n<li>local force components are rotated to ship-fixed <code class=\"notranslate\">X_ship/Y_ship</code>, with <code class=\"notranslate\">N_ship = Y_ship * yaw_lever</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Accept proposed default-speed handling:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>engineering sweep remains <code class=\"notranslate\">[1, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3, 3.5, 4, 4.5] kn</code>;</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">4.56 kn</code> is added as an extra chart-default calculation plane and flagged as outside the requested engineering sweep.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Hard stop: no implementation until user approval and <code class=\"notranslate\">status:plan-approved</code>.</p>"},{"url":"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/issues/598#issuecomment-4412617616","body":"Added the review-only placeholder engineering calculation/chart concept HTML.\n\nLinks:\n- Placeholder HTML concept: https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/blob/main/docs/plans/assets/issue-598-sirocco-current-heading-rudder-placeholder.html\n- Updated plan artifact map: https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/blob/main/docs/plans/2026-05-08-issue-598-sirocco-current-heading-rudder-force-components.md\n- Commit: https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/commit/22788a3\n\nWhat the placeholder demonstrates for review:\n- Uses the repo ecosystem's `engineering/calculation-methodology` and `data/calculation-report` patterns.\n- Shows calculation scope, inputs, equations, sign/frame notes, and limitations.\n- Includes current-speed dropdown defaulted to `4.56 kn` and flags it as the extra chart-default plane.\n- Includes rudder selector covering `-10..+10 deg`.\n- Includes two sample Plotly chart panels with explicit chart titles and axis labels:\n  1. `Chart 1 — Ship-fixed force components vs heading offset`, x-axis `Heading offset, ψ (deg)`, y-axis `Ship-fixed force component (kN)`.\n  2. `Chart 2 — Ship-fixed yaw moment response surface`, x-axis `Heading offset, ψ (deg)`, y-axis `Rudder angle, δ (deg)`, colorbar `N_ship (kN-m)`.\n\nVerification completed:\n- Static HTML structural check: PASS.\n- Browser load check via local HTTP server: PASS.\n- Browser console errors: none.\n\nNote: This is explicitly marked as a placeholder/concept-only review artifact, not the final TDD-backed implementation report. Implementation remains blocked until the plan is approved and this issue is moved to `status:plan-approved`.\n","user":{"login":"vamseeachanta","name":"vamseeachanta","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23155845?v=4","id":23155845},"id":4412617616,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":null,"review":null,"side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":"<p dir=\"auto\">Added the review-only placeholder engineering calculation/chart concept HTML.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Links:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Placeholder HTML concept: <a href=\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/blob/main/docs/plans/assets/issue-598-sirocco-current-heading-rudder-placeholder.html\">https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/blob/main/docs/plans/assets/issue-598-sirocco-current-heading-rudder-placeholder.html</a></li>\n<li>Updated plan artifact map: <a href=\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/blob/main/docs/plans/2026-05-08-issue-598-sirocco-current-heading-rudder-force-components.md\">https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/blob/main/docs/plans/2026-05-08-issue-