urrent-heading-rudder-report.md</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Validation evidence:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">PYTHONPATH=src uv run python -m pytest tests/naval_architecture/test_b1528_sirocco_current_heading_rudder.py -q</code> → 12 passed.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">git diff --cached --check</code> before commit → pass.</li>\n<li>JSON artifact validation with <code class=\"notranslate\">python -m json.tool</code> for results/provenance/manifest → pass.</li>\n<li>Static HTML contract smoke → force chart present, heatmap present, 4.56 selected, rudder +10 selected, embedded rows present.</li>\n<li>Public artifact hygiene scan for <code class=\"notranslate\">/tmp/</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">/home/</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">/mnt/local-analysis</code>, and local worktree names across generated HTML/JSON/MD/CSV → no matches.</li>\n<li>Browser verification on generated HTML: default chart state <code class=\"notranslate\">4.56 kn</code> / <code class=\"notranslate\">10 deg</code>, then dropdown update to <code class=\"notranslate\">3.5 kn</code> / <code class=\"notranslate\">5 deg</code>; force chart retained 3 traces, heatmap retained 21×21 grid and updated titles.</li>\n<li>Adversarial review returned MINOR only; hygiene findings were fixed before final validation (absolute summary semantics, YAML-driven traceability, dropdown test coverage).</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Scope caveat retained in artifacts: this is a bounded rudder-induced force-component chart set. It is not a validated oblique-current hull/rudder interaction model and does not include hull current loads, mooring-line stiffness, tug loads, bank effects, current-profile variation, or class/IMO compliance conclusions.</p>"}],"url":"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/issues/598","title":"vamseeachanta/digitalmodel Issue #598 comments","display_url":"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/digitalmodel/issues/598","display_title":"vamsee