auge \\u2192 <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">{}</code> (keys absent).</li>\\n<li><strong>Claude P2 stale-overlay signal</strong>: consumer signature \\u2192 <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">Tuple[Optional[ProcessedRecord], bool]</code>. <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">is_stale=True</code> iff source_registry_sha256 mismatches.</li>\\n<li><strong>Gemini P3 CLAUDE.md path reconciliation</strong>: live <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">git ls-files</code> confirms flat path <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">knowledge/wikis/&lt;domain&gt;/CLAUDE.md</code> exists for all 4 domains; Gemini r3 attested wrong path (no <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">/wiki/</code> segment). Plan corrects.</li>\\n<li><strong>Gemini P3 quoted source_id</strong>: regex tolerates optional quotes via <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">^source_id:\\\\\\\\s*\\\"?...\\\"?\\\\\\\\s*$</code>.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Hyphen-path grep: 0 matches.</p>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Cross-review of v4 dispatching.</p>\"}, {\"url\": \"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/llm-wiki/issues/25#issuecomment-4383543297\", \"body\": \"## House-cleaning note \\u2014 `4aad18049`\\n\\nCross-branch contamination caused by a checkout-failure-then-add chain on 2026-04-25 (the v5 plan for vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2369 was accidentally committed to this branch as commit `5206282fe`). Reverted via `4aad18049` so the vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2369 v5 plan no longer pollutes this branch's tree. The legitimate vamseeachanta/workspace-hub#2369 v5 plan lives at branch `plan/issue-2369-batch-pack-2` @ `b24b3f2dc`. Adding this to memory: 'cp untracked file before failed checkout silently lands on wrong branch when commit happens before recovery.'\", \"user\": {\"login\": \"vamseeachanta\", \"name\": \"vamseeachanta\", \"email\": null, \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23155845?v=4\", \"id\": 23155845}, \"id\": 4383543297, \"pull_request_review_id\": null, \"in_reply_to_id\": null, \"created_at\": null, \"revie