rkspace-hub#2369</a> v5 plan lives at branch <code class=\"notranslate\">plan/issue-2369-batch-pack-2</code> @ <code class=\"notranslate\">b24b3f2dc</code>. Adding this to memory: 'cp untracked file before failed checkout silently lands on wrong branch when commit happens before recovery.'</p>"},{"url":"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/llm-wiki/issues/25#issuecomment-4383543347","body":"## Cross-review v4 — `5c6e6bed5`\n\n**Claude:** **MAJOR** — 2 P1s + 4 P2s + 4 P3s. Top P1s:\n1. Internal count contradiction in §Evidence: prose says '25/13' but table says '23/15/2'; one is stale\n2. AC-vs-allow-list contradiction: AC requires review artifacts in `scripts/review/results/` but allow-list guard forbids `scripts/**` writes; either carve out or move artifacts to owned path\n**Gemini:** **MAJOR (FALSE POSITIVE — OVERLAY-BLINDNESS)** — claims `marine-engineering/CLAUDE.md`, `maritime-law/CLAUDE.md`, `naval-architecture/CLAUDE.md` MISSING. Verified locally: `git ls-files | grep CLAUDE.md` shows all 3 EXIST at `knowledge/wikis/<domain>/CLAUDE.md`. Same overlay-blindness pattern documented in `feedback_gemini_sandbox_overlay_blindness.md`. Gemini's sandbox can't see the sparse-checkout overlay. **Discounting this verdict.**\n**Codex:** UNAVAILABLE (#2479)\n\n**Effective consensus:** Claude's 2 P1s are real and surgical → v5 needed.\n\nResult files:\n- `scripts/review/results/20260425T101312Z-2026-04-23-issue-2364-batch-pack-1-api-standards-portal-promotion.md-plan-claude.md`\n- `scripts/review/results/20260425T101552Z-2026-04-23-issue-2364-batch-pack-1-api-standards-portal-promotion.md-plan-gemini.md`","user":{"login":"vamseeachanta","name":"vamseeachanta","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23155845?v=4","id":23155845},"id":4383543347,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":null,"review":null,"side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":"<h2 dir=\"auto\">Cross-review v4 — <code class=\"notranslate\">5c6e6bed5</code></h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Claude:</strong> <strong>MAJOR</strong> — 2 P1s + 4 P2s + 4 P3s. Top P1s:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Internal count contradiction in §Evidence: prose says '25/13' but table says '23/15/2'; one is stale</li>\n<li>AC-vs-allow-list contradiction: AC requires review artifacts in <code class=\"notranslate\">scripts/review/results/</code> but allow-list guard forbids <code class=\"notranslate\">scripts/**</code> writes; either carve out or move artifacts to owned path<br>\n<strong>Gemini:</strong> <strong>MAJOR (FALSE POSITIVE — OVERLAY-BLINDNESS)</strong> — claims <code class=\"notranslate\">marine-engineering/CLAUDE.md</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">maritime-law/CLAUDE.md</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">naval-architecture/CLAUDE.md</code> MISSING. Verified locally: <code class=\"notranslate\">git ls-files | grep CLAUDE.md</code> shows all 3 EXIST at <code class=\"notranslate\">knowledge/wikis/&lt;domain&gt;/CLAUDE.md</code>. Same overlay-blindness pattern documented in <code class=\"notranslate\">feedback_gemini_sandbox_overlay_blindness.md</code>. Gemini's sandbox can't see the sparse-checkout overlay. <strong>Discounting this verdict.</strong><br>\n<strong>Codex:</strong> UNAVAILABLE (#2479)</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Effective consensus:</strong> Claude's 2 P1s are real and surgical → v5 needed.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Result files:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">scripts/review/results/20260425T101312Z-2026-04-23-issue-2364-batch-pack-1-api-standards-portal-promotion.md-plan-claude.md</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">scripts/review/results/20260425T101552Z-2026-04-23-issue-2364-batch-pack-1-api-standards-portal-promotion.md-plan-gemini.md</code></li>\n</ul>"},{"url":"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/llm-wiki/issues/25#issuecomment-4383543389","body":"## v5 drafted — `7cc1c0b1a` (count contradiction resolved, allow-list carve-out)\n\nBranch: `plan/issue-2364-batch-pa