ilter count (plan says \"~N candidates\" without concrete target → cannot falsifiably test)\n3. Provide design-code-registry existence evidence in §Resource Intelligence (referenced but not cited)\n4. Specify slug-normalization rule (how standard-ID → filename maps; CSA-Z276.1-20 → `csa-z276-1-20.md`?)\n5. Add falsifiable `no_source_reads` check (plan forbids raw-PDF reads but test doesn't enforce)\n6. Stratified provenance sample (uniform sampling masks high-cardinality publisher skew)\n7. Lane B1 serialization mechanism (plan assumes Lane B1 plans land before vamseeachanta/llm-wiki#26 promotion starts — needs explicit dependency declaration)\n8. Fix broken `grep -v -E` regex in exclusion step (character class has unescaped `-`)\n\n**P2/P3 optional hardening** (5 additional items in `/tmp/lane-b2-2373-summary.md`).\n\n**Gemini false-positives (disregard):**\n- \"Missing: `data/document-index/shards/ace-shard-*.json`\" — all 10 shards exist\n- \"Missing: `knowledge/wikis/engineering/wiki/standards/*.md`\" — all 7 standards pages exist\n\nArtifacts: `scripts/review/results/2026-04-23-plan-2373-{claude,codex,gemini}.md`\n\nNot eligible for `status:plan-review` until v2 addresses Claude's 8 items. User approval required.\n","user":{"login":"vamseeachanta","name":"vamseeachanta","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23155845?v=4","id":23155845},"id":4383543698,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":null,"review":null,"side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":"<p dir=\"auto\">R1 cross-review complete (2026-04-23):</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Claude: MAJOR</strong> — 3 P1 blockers + 5 P2/P3 defects (all real)</li>\n<li><strong>Codex: UNAVAILABLE</strong> — same <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4297731336\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/vamseeachanta/workspace-hub/issues/2406\" data-hovercar